<title>ITALY: BANK OF ITALY SELLING UP TO 2.0 TRLN LIRE BOT.</title>
<headline>BANK OF ITALY SELLING UP TO 2.0 TRLN LIRE BOT.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it was offering to sell up to 2.0 trillion lire ($1.1 billion) of August 29 short term bills (BOT). Bids must be received by 0745 GMT.</p>
</text>
